      <title>When Did Jesus become a Catholic?</title>
      <link>https://www.franciscanmedia.org/ask-a-franciscan/when-did-jesus-become-a-catholic/</link>
      <description>Q: A few years ago, I overheard a Catholic woman ask her friend, "When did Jesus become a Catholic?" A few of us laughed but did try to explain that Jesus was the Christ. He was born Jewish and died Jewish. One of my Jewish friends asked me, "When did Jesus become a Christian?" Soon after that, a relative asked me, "Well, when did he become a Catholic?" Please address these questions in your column.</description>
